### Test 1: Save - Create vehicle
POST {{baseUrl}}/Vehicle/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "licensePlate": "C123ABC",
  "vehicleName": "Camión 12",
  "color": "Blanco",
  "makerId": 45,
  "modelId": 812,
  "year": 2022,
  "vehicleTypeId": 7,
  "fuelEconomy": 6.5,
  "fuelEconomyMargin": 0.5
}

### Test 2: Save - Create vehicle with fuel tank and seal
POST {{baseUrl}}/Vehicle/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "licensePlate": "C456DEF",
  "color": "Rojo",
  "makerId": 45,
  "modelId": 812,
  "fuelEconomy": 6.5,
  "fuelEconomyMargin": 0.5,
  "fuelTanks": [
    {
      "fuelTankName": "Principal",
      "capacity": 200,
      "sensorId": 3312,
      "loadThreshold": 15,
      "unloadThreshold": 10
    }
  ],
  "securitySeals": [
    {
      "code": "MAR-000981",
      "description": "Tapa de tanque"
    }
  ]
}

### Test 3: Save - Partial update (only color)
