Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": 9812,
  "color": "Azul"
}

### Test 4: Save - Remove all fuel tanks
POST {{baseUrl}}/Vehicle/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": 9812,
  "fuelTanks": []
}

